#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:239
#: de58155e11724e16878d2431ae0d7649
msgid "Navigate to the specified position."
msgstr "飞往指定位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:245
#: bdaa82b622bc4bd985423b3ce476ee71
msgid ""
"The vehicle will fly to the specified latitude, longitude and altitude. The "
"waypoint is considered \"complete\" when Plane is within the specified "
"radius of the target location, at which point Plane processes the next "
"command."
msgstr "飞行器将飞往指定的纬度、经度和高度。当 Plane 位于目标位置的指定半径内时，航点被视为「完成」，Plane 随后处理下一个命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:250
#: 72ab55319f544ceba769c90bcad835a3
msgid ""
"The protocol additionally provides for the plane to circle the waypoint with"
" a specified radius and direction for a specified time (Delay). These "
"parameters are not supported by Copter."
msgstr "该协议还允许飞机以指定的半径和方向绕航点盘旋指定时间（延迟）。这些参数在 Copter 上不受支持。"

