msgid ""
"Takeoff (either from the ground or by hand-launch). It should be the first "
"command of nearly all Plane and Copter missions."
msgstr "起飞（从地面或手抛起飞）。该指令应作为几乎所有 Plane 和 Copter 任务的第一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:324
#: cd22b639d97446c6a30e24d4aada33b1
msgid ""
"The plane climbs to the specified altitude (at the specified pitch/climb "
"angle) before proceeding to the next waypoint."
msgstr "飞机爬升到指定高度（以指定的俯仰/爬升角度）后再继续前往下一个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:327
#: 968c0628aa7a4449b21eefec0a9ef866
msgid ""
"The plane is *only* attempting to climb at this point and can be pushed off "
"its heading by wind. The pitch value is the *minimum* climb angle when using"
" an airspeed sensor, and *maximum* angle when **not** using an airspeed "
"sensor."
msgstr "此时飞机*仅*尝试爬升，可能被风吹偏离航向。俯仰值是使用空速传感器时的*最小*爬升角，以及 **不** 使用空速传感器时的*最大*角度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:383
#: 8c66214ba42441c4b31678506da796d3
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:385
#: f5f96a88f8f446a291bb5b20b61d3e34
msgid "Supported by:  Plane  (not Copter or Rover). Specifically QuadPlanes."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter / Rover）。具体为 QuadPlane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:387
#: b138bc00a67c41dda7abf7866586e978
msgid "Takeoff while in VTOL mode."
msgstr "在 VTOL 模式下起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:389
#: 37d9322c633449d4873dc961ddda2f59
msgid ""
"The vehicle will climb straight up from it’s current location to the "
"specified altitude as a delta above its current altitude."
msgstr "飞行器将从当前位置垂直爬升到指定高度，该高度为当前高度之上的增量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:392
#: 2baad98135e74ad3b2651a9d874ab4a7
msgid ""
"However, if :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 3 is set (use altitude reference"
" frames for VTOL takeoff), then the altitude value (in the specified "
"reference frame) will be used for the target altitude, instead of a delta "
"above the current altitude. If the command is begun while the vehicle is "
"already flying, the vehicle will climb straight up to the specified "
"altitude, if the vehicle is already above the altitude the command will be "
"ignored and the mission will move on to the next command immediately."
msgstr ""
"但是，如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 3 被置位（使用高度参考坐标系进行 VTOL "
"起飞），则该高度值（在指定参考坐标系下）会作为目标高度使用，而不是相对当前高度的增量。如果指令开始时载具已在飞行中，载具将直接爬升到指定高度；如果载具已经高于该高度，指令将被忽略，任务立即进入下一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:454
#: 14ef82e26e55430195e1c9ac3379b7f7
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_UNLIM"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_UNLIM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:458
#: bf7dcdd91f3046ed9d37a62638c7702c
msgid "Loiter at the specified location for an unlimited amount of time."
msgstr "在指定位置无限期悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:464
#: 76d613f9a4eb4f6aa0a265bd489b9f59
msgid ""
"Fly to the specified location and then loiter there indefinitely — where "
"loiter means \"circle the waypoint\". If zero is specified for a "
"latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current location value for "
"the parameter will be used. You can also specify the radius and direction "
"for the loiter."
msgstr ""
"飞到指定位置并在那里无限期 Loiter——这里的 Loiter 指「绕航点盘旋」。若纬度/经度/高度任一参数指定为 "
"0，则使用当前位置作为该参数的值。也可指定盘旋半径与方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:470
#: 6603c687b34b4e299fb8ca0ebc87c0d8
msgid ""
"The mission will not proceed past this command while in AUTO mode. In order "
"to break out of this command you need to change the mode (i.e. to MANUAL). "
"If there are subsequent commands then you can continue the mission at the "
"next command, if the Copter ``MIS_RESTART`` parameter is set to resume, by "
"switching back to AUTO mode (otherwise the mission will restart)."
msgstr ""
"在 AUTO 模式下，任务不会跳过此指令继续执行。要退出此指令，需要切换飞行模式（例如切换到 MANUAL 模式）。如果后续还有其他指令，可将飞行器的 "
"``MIS_RESTART`` 参数设置为恢复模式，然后切换回 AUTO 模式以从下一条指令继续任务（否则任务将从头开始）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:532
#: ec6765b4dc83411095ccc7f76fb3d594
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TURNS"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TURNS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:541
#: 033e5ad0eb8f4bb2be79b4471ea0c0a8
msgid ""
"Loiter (circle) the specified location for at least the specified number of "
"complete turns, and then proceed to the next command upon intersection of "
"the course to it with the circle's perimeter. If zero is specified for a "
"latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current location value for "
"the parameter will be used. Fractional turns between 0 and 1 are supported, "
"while turns greater than 1 must be integers."
msgstr ""
"在指定位置盘旋（绕圈）至少指定的完整圈数，然后在飞行路线与圆弧相交时继续执行下一条指令。如果纬度/经度/高度参数中任一指定为零，则使用该参数的当前位置值。支持"
" 0 到 1 之间的小数圈数，大于 1 的圈数必须为整数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:545
#: 17bffd2efc8a42bcab769a593b807aa0
msgid ""
"The radius of the circle is controlled by the command parameter. A radius of"
" 0 will result in :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` being used as the "
"radius. Negative radius values result in counter-clockwise turns instead of "
"clockwise turns. Radius values over 255 meters will be rounded down to the "
"nearest 10 meter mark. Once the number of turns is completed, continue to "
"loiter until heading points to next nav waypoint. If XTrack Tangent param "
"=1, proceed directly to next waypoint, otherwise, track to the path in a "
"line between the waypoint centers. =1."
msgstr ""
"盘旋半径由指令参数控制。半径为 0 时将使用 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` "
"作为半径。负值半径表示逆时针盘旋（而非顺时针）。超过 255 米的半径会向下取整到最近的 10 米刻度。盘旋指定圈数后，会继续 Loiter "
"直到机头朝向下一个导航航点。若 XTrack Tangent 参数 = 1，则直接前往下一航点；否则沿两航点中心连线进入下一段轨迹。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:605
#: 12d97b02aa204b50bc8121fa6596d772
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TIME"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TIME"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:607
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1332
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1392
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1656
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2230
#: 70a868dd314e4928b68e3278a807c649 91518c8ffb7c4e8b9d521f1236829317
#: 94519035771d4b728775db32dd3347e8 c206ca6db938446aadec7b0edffa4c6d
#: fd7c86779a894474993f55d2117037ca
msgid "Supported by: Copter, Plane, Rover."
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter、Plane、Rover。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:612
#: fdc877e18faa46258d332103d7983696
msgid ""
"Fly to the specified location and then loiter there for the specified number"
" of seconds — where loiter means \"circle the waypoint\". The timer starts "
"when the waypoint is reached; when it expires the waypoint is complete. If "
"zero is specified for a latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the "
"current location value for the parameter will be used. You can also specify "
"the radius and direction for the loiter. Once time has elapsed, continue to "
"loiter until heading points to next nav waypoint. If XTrack Tangent param = "
"gb1, proceed directly to next waypoint, otherwise, track to the path in a "
"line between the waypoint centers."
msgstr ""
"飞到指定位置并在那里 Loiter 指定的秒数——这里的 Loiter "
"指「绕航点盘旋」。计时器在到达航点时开始；到时后该航点完成。若纬度/经度/高度任一参数指定为 "
"0，则使用当前位置作为该参数的值。也可指定盘旋半径与方向。计时结束后，会继续 Loiter 直到机头朝向下一个导航航点。若 XTrack Tangent"
" 参数 = 1，则直接前往下一航点；否则沿两航点中心连线进入下一段轨迹。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:623
#: 3f1859bcde7449ba85d088924e178756
msgid "The radius of the loiter is set in the ``WP_LOITER_RAD`` parameter."
msgstr "盘旋半径在 ``WP_LOITER_RAD`` 参数中设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:678
#: 84d958df0b8747dc9a6379108bc7af69
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_RETURN_TO_LAUNCH"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_RETURN_TO_LAUNCH"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:682
#: d6eed8cc125343b5b68c07704d4ccdc1
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* or the nearest `Rally Point <common-rally-"
"points>`__, if closer. The home location is where the vehicle was last armed"
" (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the vehicle configuration "
"allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*，或返回最近的 `集结点 <common-rally-points>`__ （如果更近）。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:691
#: cc109cd0f9664ba892fd497291ae7252
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* (or the nearest :ref:`Rally Point <common-"
"rally-points>` if closer) and then \"Loiter\" (circle the point). The home "
"location is where the vehicle was last armed (or when it first gets GPS lock"
" after arming if the vehicle configuration allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 点*（或更近的 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>`），然后在该点上方 Loiter（绕点盘旋）。Home"
" 点是载具上次解锁的位置（或在配置允许时为解锁后首次获得 GPS 定位的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:696
#: 23af02d4595c437997647bfc5a8dcbe6
msgid ""
"If the return is to a rally point, the plane will loiter at the position and"
" altitude set in the rally point. If the return is to the home location, "
"then the parameter :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` is used for the loiter"
" height (default 100m). The radius of the loiter is defined in the parameter"
" :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>`."
msgstr ""
"如果返回到集结点，飞机将在集结点设置的位置和高度盘旋。如果返回到 Home 位置，则使用参数 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE "
"<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 作为盘旋高度（默认 100m）。盘旋半径在参数 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>`"
" 中定义。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:704
#: 1a3e20cffd7f4172bed6961b40a40188
msgid ""
"This command takes no parameters and generally should be the last command in"
" the mission."
msgstr "此指令不需要任何参数，通常应作为任务的最后一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:765
#: 1f11150c1b664b45be9dfabf497393e8
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LAND"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LAND"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:773
#: e280cb7d024e421b94dca07d4f3fdd44
msgid ""
"The plane will land at its current location or proceed to the (non-zero) "
"lat/lon coordinates provided beginning with current altitude.  Information "
"on the parameters used to control the landing is provided in :ref:`LAND "
"flight mode <land-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"Plane 将在当前位置降落，或从当前高度飞到（非零）经纬度坐标后开始降落。控制降落的相关参数说明请参见 :ref:`LAND 飞行模式 <land-"
"mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:829
#: 9d0a60ee92a14b93b8ed166f60af5964
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_VTOL_LAND"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_VTOL_LAND"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:831
#: 96dc9351739f4358994990f2bad28b29
msgid "Supported by: Plane (not Copter or Rover). Specifically QuadPlanes."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter / Rover）。具体为 QuadPlane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:833
#: fb5f1f0a076a4bc8bb73eeb95083270e
msgid "Land the vehicle at the current or a specified location."
msgstr "在当前或指定位置降落飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:835
#: 44f24403830b4ec2aabda4b71a804617
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 4 is not set (default),the vehicle "
"will land at its current location or proceed at the current altitude to the "
"lat/lon coordinates provided (if non-zero) and land. The ALT parameter is "
"used to determine final landing phase initiation rather than "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>`. This is the mission equivalent of"
" the :ref:`QLAND flight mode <qland-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 4 "
"未置位（默认），载具将在当前位置降落，或保持当前高度飞到所提供的（非零）经纬度坐标后再降落。ALT 参数用于决定何时进入最终降落阶段，取代了 "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` 的作用。该指令是 :ref:`QLAND 飞行模式 <qland-"
"mode>` 的任务版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:838
#: 006f0300c2f44f519c56d5c521c2003d
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 4 is set (Use a fixed wind spiral "
"approach), the it will fly in plane mode to the lat/lon coordinates provided"
" (if non-zero), climbing or descending to the altitude set in the "
"NAV_VTOL_LAND waypoint. When it reaches within "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` of the landing location, it will "
"perform a LOITER_TO_ALT to finish the climb or descent to that ALT set in "
"the waypoint, then, turning into the wind, transition to VTOL mode and "
"proceed to the landing location and land."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 4 "
"位被设置（使用固定翼螺旋进近），它将以固定翼模式飞向提供的纬经度坐标（如果非零），爬升或下降到 NAV_VTOL_LAND "
"航点中设置的高度。当到达距降落位置 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 以内时，将执行 "
"LOITER_TO_ALT 以完成爬升或下降到航点中设置的该高度，然后迎风转向，过渡到 VTOL 模式并前往降落位置降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:840
#: 7e013c34efd84c14ac74283f740a37d1
msgid "The motors will disarm on their own once landed"
msgstr "降落后电机将自动上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:842
#: d6cb5da35714461cae6f6641f7ebc0fb
msgid ""
"param1 of the command acts just like :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 4 "
"above, if that option bit is not set. This allows the use of different "
"approaches for different VTOL_LAND commands within the same mission."
msgstr ""
"如果该选项位未设置，命令的 param1 行为就像上述 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 4 位一样。这允许在同一任务中的不同"
" VTOL_LAND 命令使用不同的进近方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:901
#: 8f4b15a4a0b9470a9473c00e2d53e3e3
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_CONTINUE_AND_CHANGE_ALT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_CONTINUE_AND_CHANGE_ALT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:903
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2098
#: 2f27995c686f4be4af3886d6df429e5d 421804ce36bf48c09b964197208d17c8
msgid "Supported by: Plane (not Copter, Rover)."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter、Rover）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:905
#: 399641c78170486b9bb89a17363f0a13
msgid ""
"Continue on the current course and climb/descend to a specified altitude. "
"Move to the next command when the desired altitude is reached."
msgstr "继续当前航向并爬升/下降到指定高度。当到达所需高度时移至下一个命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:910
#: 0d48afbda62c4de189338f7157d5bf10
msgid ""
"The ``param1`` value sets how close the vehicle altitude must be to target "
"altitude for command completion."
msgstr "``param1`` 值设置飞行器高度与目标高度的接近程度，以完成命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:978
#: 6512728d564e417a8d8e8597742776f6
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_ALTITUDE_WAIT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_ALTITUDE_WAIT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:980
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1044
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2796
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2866
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2924
#: 4f271fe849304044b5e8336407535549 63623ef771b74e139971421053d0f371
#: a5b0d128a7834ea48e8e21e2cc248c6c b9f5f791e92243e8b78df4ebc0fc9921
#: c0185fe1d9fb42f299c91b30b15b0efd
msgid "Supported by: Plane (not Copter or Rover)."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter / Rover）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:982
#: 3d8803b21e764a3da5bc8e619ce5f185
msgid ""
"Mission command to wait for an altitude or downward vertical speed. This is "
"meant for high-altitude balloon launches, allowing the aircraft to be idle "
"until either an altitude is reached or a negative vertical speed is reached "
"(indicating early balloon burst). The wiggle time is how often to wiggle the"
" control surfaces to prevent them from seizing up."
msgstr ""
"任务命令，等待到达某高度或向下垂直速度。这用于高空气球发射，允许飞机保持待机，直到到达某高度或达到负垂直速度（表示气球提前破裂）。摆动时间是多久摆动一次控制面以防止它们因长时间静止而卡死。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1042
#: 589f8fd87ee642beaff4b0831a92b562
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TO_ALT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TO_ALT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1046
#: 70866c576e5346469646bcea9b1ac509
msgid "Loiter while climbing/descending to an altitude."
msgstr "在爬升/下降至某高度时盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1048
#: 3e21b3509a4b464cb48c68ec38c96b6f
msgid ""
"Begin loitering at the specified Latitude and Longitude. If Lat=Lon=0, then "
"loiter at the current position. Don't consider the navigation command "
"complete (don't leave loiter) until the altitude has been reached. Continue "
"to loiter until heading points to next nav waypoint. If XTrack Tangent param"
" =1, proceed directly to next waypoint, otherwise, track to the path in a "
"line between the waypoint centers."
msgstr ""
"在指定纬度和经度开始盘旋。如果纬度=经度=0，则在当前位置盘旋。在到达高度之前不认为导航命令完成（不离开盘旋），继续盘旋直到航向指向下一个导航航点。如果"
" XTrack 切线参数=1，直接前往下一个航点，否则沿航点中心之间的线路追踪路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1111
#: 80db760845b54539a9423f151796c341
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_DELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_DELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1113
#: ca2caadbe3654dc38a917c8cd7ea80c0
msgid "Supported by: Copter, Rover, Plane."
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter、Rover、Plane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1118
#: 56e92a130d944a8d895f5769ab330179
msgid ""
"After reaching this waypoint, if disarmed, delay the execution of the next "
"mission command until the time in seconds has elapsed. This is used in a "
"mission to allow a vehicle to land, disarm for a period (for a payload "
"change for example), and then re-arm, and takeoff to resume the mission. If "
"not disarmed, this mission item is skipped."
msgstr ""
"到达此航点后，如果已解锁，则延迟执行下一个任务命令，直到指定秒数过去。这用于任务中允许飞行器降落、解锁一段时间（例如用于更换载荷），然后重新解锁、起飞继续任务。如果未解锁，则跳过此任务项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1177
#: e22b1fe408804ced8a603374e7c981bc
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_PAYLOAD_PLACE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_PAYLOAD_PLACE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1179
#: 6b0f956725c54c14bb3f93e6a9de90e6
msgid "Supported by: Copter and Plane."
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter 和 Plane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1183
#: 77859a97b492498381169636e4946b63
msgid ""
"**QUADPLANE ONLY, fixed wing planes will skip this command** After reaching "
"this waypoint, the vehicle will have transitioned to VTOL and will descend "
"up to the maximum descent value. If the vehicle has not touched the ground "
"before this limit is reached, the vehicle will climb back up to the waypoint"
" altitude and continue to the next mission item. If it reaches the ground, "
"it will stop its motors and wait for a LUA script command (see `Package "
"Place LUA applet "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/plane_package_place.lua>`__"
" ) to send an abort_landing command to ascend back to the waypoint altitude "
"and continue to the next mission item, be sent a disarm command, or the "
"pilot uses the ``RCx_OPTION`` = 173 to send the abort_landing command, "
"instead of via a LUA script. This allows the gripper to be commanded to be "
"released, packages replaced, etc."
msgstr ""
"**仅适用于四旋翼飞机，固定翼飞机将跳过此命令** 到达此航点后，飞行器将过渡到 VTOL "
"并下降至最大下降值。如果飞行器在达到此限制之前未触地，飞行器将爬回至航点高度并继续前往下一个任务项。如果它接触地面，将停止电机并等待 LUA "
"脚本命令（见 `包裹放置 LUA 小程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/plane_package_place.lua>`__）发送中止降落命令以上升回航点高度并继续前往下一个任务项，或发送解锁命令，或飞手使用"
" ``RCx_OPTION`` = 173 发送中止降落命令而非通过 LUA 脚本。这允许命令释放夹持器、更换包裹等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1187
#: 7da0d07b75964790916a10bd29863509
msgid "[wiki site=\"copter,plane\"] **Command parameters**"
msgstr "[wiki site=\"copter,plane\"] **指令参数**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1238
#: 659c888ac4cd4f258787f861569c4db2
msgid "[/site]"
msgstr "[/site]"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1243
#: fcb8b5b53d5942e2892189e3e3770fba
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1247
#: a6d249eb43224c41af3efb43201fcc97
msgid ""
"Jump to the specified command in the mission list. The jump command can be "
"repeated either a specified number of times before continuing the mission, "
"or it can be repeated indefinitely."
msgstr "跳转到任务列表中指定的指令。跳转指令可以在继续任务前重复指定次数，也可以无限期重复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1253
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1400
#: 2fd8c3520d77478184608bc9fc6872d0 934ff585e9a14948b2df0bad9ce6115d
msgid ""
"Despite the name, this command is really a \"NAV\\_\" command rather than a "
"\"DO\\_\" command. Conditional commands like CONDITION_DELAY don't affect "
"DO_JUMP (it will always perform the jump as soon as it reaches the command)."
msgstr ""
"尽管名称如此，此指令实际上是 「NAV\\_」 指令而非 「DO\\_」 指令。CONDITION_DELAY 等条件指令不影响 "
"DO_JUMP（飞行器到达该指令时会立即执行跳转）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1260
#: 3b41e11fc2004af4a875011eacb02cc3
msgid ""
"There can be a maximum of 15 jump commands in a mission after which new "
"DO_JUMP commands are ignored."
msgstr "一次任务中最多可有 15 条跳转指令，超出后新的 DO_JUMP 指令将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1317
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1464
