#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1322
#: 9961cc4538054e6b81980ce5688d8e0d
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_JUMP command"
msgstr "DO_JUMP 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1324
#: 6ac379823a7a49e79948f18ce14c4da9
msgid ""
"In the example above the vehicle would fly back-and-forth between waypoints "
"#1 and #2 a total of 3 times before flying on to waypoint #4."
msgstr "在上述示例中，飞行器将在航点 #1 和 #2 之间来回飞行共 3 次，然后继续飞往航点 #4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1330
#: 8a6e903ae7e8456e9fb91a9fe553fd78
msgid "MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1334
#: cde714a9758745b89166eae75adba4ea
msgid ""
"This is a location marker in the mission command sequence that can be used "
"as a \"jump to\" location for the "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG>` command. The tag id in its "
"parameter field can be any arbitrary number between 1 and 65535."
msgstr ""
"这是任务指令序列中的位置标记，可作为 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG>` "
"指令的「跳转目标」位置。参数字段中的标签 ID 可以是 1 到 65535 之间的任意数字。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1390
#: befb0c3ca6ed434f8c6dc72cf1ecfab2
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1394
#: ac83bc10f5da4338be11d64b43e1f47b
msgid ""
"Jump to the specified :ref:`MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG>` item in the "
"mission list. The jump tag command can be repeated, either a specified "
"number of times before continuing the mission, or it can be repeated "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"跳转到任务列表中指定的 :ref:`MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG>` "
"项。跳转标签指令可以重复，在继续任务前重复指定次数，也可以无限期重复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1407
#: 2d0ba0c0793242e3850e5fc53acea149
msgid ""
"There can be a maximum of 15 jump_tag commands in a mission after which new "
"DO_JUMP_TAG commands are ignored."
msgstr "一次任务中最多可有 15 条 jump_tag 指令，超出后新的 DO_JUMP_TAG 指令将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1469
#: b1e53dbcc009455f999b125f971e4450
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_JUMP_TAG command"
msgstr "DO_JUMP_TAG 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1471
#: 29ee8120e34e4724a38d38a3f563c12e
msgid ""
"In the example above, the vehicle would fly back-and-forth between waypoints"
" #3 and #4 a total of 3 times before completing the mission. This is because"
" the DO_JUMP_TAG redirects the vehicle to JUMP_TAG #565 twice."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，飞行器将在航点 #3 和 #4 之间来回飞行共 3 次后完成任务。这是因为 DO_JUMP_TAG 将飞行器重定向到 JUMP_TAG "
"#565 两次。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1474
#: c6b462d94de54e488c22bda11c19a8c9
msgid "Conditional commands"
msgstr "条件指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1476
#: 91ca5ed594a943359a28bbc7a3f2ddd5
msgid ""
"Conditional commands control the execution of \\_DO\\_ commands. For "
"example, a conditional command can prevent DO commands from executing based "
"on a time delay, until the vehicle is at a certain altitude, or at a "
"specified distance from the next target position."
msgstr "条件指令控制 \\_DO\\_ 指令的执行。例如，条件指令可以根据时间延迟、直到飞行器到达特定高度或距下一目标位置特定距离来阻止 DO 指令执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1481
#: 6fb77e3f982e4951aaa28743dc7b5742
msgid ""
"A conditional command may not be complete before reaching the next waypoint."
" In this case, any unexecuted \\_DO\\_ commands associated with the last "
"waypoint will be skipped."
msgstr "条件指令可能在到达下一个航点前尚未完成。在这种情况下，与上一个航点相关联的任何未执行的 \\_DO\\_ 指令将被跳过。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1488
#: 947e04303a0246e2accdaebde6b52599
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1492
#: 574f4457d52b455c835e463d52f59afe
msgid ""
"After reaching a waypoint, delay the execution of the next conditional "
"\"_DO_\" command for the specified number of seconds (e.g. "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI <mav_cmd_do_set_roi>`)."
msgstr ""
"到达航点后，将下一条条件「_DO_」指令（例如 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI "
"<mav_cmd_do_set_roi>`）的执行延迟指定秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1498
#: 9286148d42da47639168181a4f76a892
msgid ""
"This command does not stop the vehicle. If the vehicle reaches the next "
"waypoint before the delay timer completes, the delayed \"_DO_\" commands "
"will never trigger."
msgstr "此指令不会停止飞行器。如果飞行器在延迟计时器完成前到达下一个航点，延迟的「_DO_」指令将永远不会触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1557
#: b6fabd44ed7e45ddb73d46569aa9f287
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for CONDITION_DELAY command"
msgstr "CONDITION_DELAY 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1559
#: 553054ff0b2c4df8968f22148d1e9a2a
msgid ""
"In the example above, Command #4 (``DO_SET_ROI``) is delayed so that it "
"starts 5 seconds after the vehicle has passed Waypoint #2."
msgstr "在上述示例中，指令 #4（``DO_SET_ROI``）被延迟，使其在飞行器经过航点 #2 后 5 秒才开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1566
#: acc76d99c45b4d2fa01e208387ead989
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1570
#: 0dfc454f5c6a4c7da73851de3262eec6
msgid ""
"Delays the start of the next \"``_DO_``\\ \" command until the vehicle is "
"within the specified number of meters of the next waypoint."
msgstr "延迟下一条「``_DO_``\\ 」指令的执行，直到飞行器距下一个航点在指定米数范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1575
#: efcdad05c6ce44b88d4257546024641d
msgid "This command does not stop the vehicle: it only affects DO commands."
msgstr "此指令不会停止飞行器：它只影响 DO 指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1632
#: 812807c617534e4291eb4bd08c68201d
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for CONDITION_DISTANCE command"
msgstr "CONDITION_DISTANCE 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1634
#: d952adbbb78141489339859bb5fcb2fa
msgid ""
"In the example above, Command #4 (``DO_SET_ROI``) is delayed so that it only"
" starts once the vehicle is within 50m of waypoint #5."
msgstr "在上述示例中，指令 #4（``DO_SET_ROI``）被延迟，使其仅在飞行器距航点 #5 50m 范围内时才开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1644
#: fe12bddf695f4b21994eebac84d3f8d2
msgid "DO commands"
msgstr "DO 指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1646
#: 9a9ec6df2353476b99ab3c14370593c0
msgid ""
"The \"DO\" or \"Now\" commands are executed once to perform some action. All"
" the DO commands associated with a waypoint are executed immediately."
msgstr "「DO」或「立即」指令被执行一次以执行某个动作。与航点相关的所有 DO 指令立即执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1654
#: d8ab631fe1b8409584cc0874d003c313
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1662
#: 15e88cc85734405f9db4d8069461e524
msgid ""
"Change the target horizontal speed (airspeed or groundspeed) and/or the "
"vehicle's throttle. If the airspeed option is selected, this changes the "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` parameter during the flight until "
"reboot or mode is changed to CRUISE or FBWB. If the groundspeed option is "
"used, then :ref:`MIN_GROUNDSPEED<MIN_GROUNDSPEED>` parameter is changed to "
"this value until rebooted or changed by this command again. If the throttle "
"field is non-zero and equal to or below 100, then the "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` parameter is changed  until reboot or "
"changed by this command again."
msgstr ""
"改变目标水平速度（空速或地速）和/或飞行器油门。如果选择了空速选项，这将在飞行中更改 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 参数，直到重启或模式更改为 Cruise 或 "
"FBWB。如果使用地速选项，则 :ref:`MIN_GROUNDSPEED<MIN_GROUNDSPEED>` "
"参数将更改为此值，直到重启或再次由此命令更改。如果油门字段非零且等于或低于 100，则 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 参数将更改，直到重启或再次由此命令更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1665
#: f2fea25f36b04511b01a43fc66e7f547
msgid ""
"Speed changes only have an effect if an airspeed sensor is present, healthy,"
" and in use. :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` changes impacts only flight"
" with airspeed sensor not in use."
msgstr ""
"速度变化仅在空速传感器存在、健康且正在使用时才有效。:ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"的变化仅影响未使用空速传感器的飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1724
#: 35c1d3ffcec14d7eb94f205162f60573
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1728
#: 2ccce370ffa54b549f913aa36dcb0342
msgid ""
"Sets the home location either as the current location or at the location "
"specified in the command. For SITL work, altitude input here needs to be "
"with reference to absolute altitude, taking into account SRTM elevation."
msgstr "将 Home 位置设置为当前位置或指令中指定的位置。对于 SITL 工作，此处输入的高度需参考绝对高度，并考虑 SRTM 高程数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1733
#: 769e8d5d32ba4f1eb5599f012d0a0bbc
msgid ""
"For Plane and Rover, if a good GPS fix cannot be obtained the location "
"specified in the command is used."
msgstr "对于 Plane 和 Rover，如果无法获取良好的 GPS 定位，则使用指令中指定的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1735
#: ca7e90190f514d7b8f7aaa1c6c39705b
msgid ""
"For Copter, the command will also try to use the current position if all the"
" location parameters are set to 0. The location information in the command "
"is only used if it is close to the EKF origin."
msgstr "对于 Copter，如果所有位置参数均设置为 0，该指令也会尝试使用当前位置。指令中的位置信息仅在其接近 EKF 原点时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1800
#: 77ae36c60ce64e23b954d5a455c36cd3
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_SET_HOME command"
msgstr "DO_SET_HOME 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1805
#: ab71966a1e6c4414a2edf4d905a58c6f
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_RELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_RELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1809
#: f05616e989e14845876845eda2f124a3
msgid "Set a `Relay <common-relay>`__ pin's voltage high (on) or low (off)."
msgstr "将 `继电器 <common-relay>`__ 引脚电压设为高电平（开）或低电平（关）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1872
#: 49cf555d032a4a5a8d7c0f2a81f91ab1
msgid "MissionPlanner Settings for DO_SET_RELAY command"
msgstr "DO_SET_RELAY 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1877
#: dee64d56a76742998b907722a2ee4baf
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_RELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_RELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1881
#: 51f6d172edeb4a309b88d60d4a8a9b60
msgid ""
"Toggle the :ref:`Relay <common-relay>` pin's voltage/state a specified "
"number of times with a given period. Toggling the Relay will turn an off "
"relay on and vice versa"
msgstr "以给定周期将 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>` 引脚电压/状态切换指定次数。切换继电器将使关闭的继电器打开，反之亦然"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1939
#: 889f09bf170a46ff9131b7476799fdab
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_RELAY_REPEAT command"
msgstr "DO_RELAY_REPEAT 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1941
#: c626ea830f5d47738baabf2127132096
msgid ""
"In the example above, assuming the relay was off to begin with, it would be "
"set high and then after 3 seconds, it would be toggled low again."
msgstr "在上述示例中，假设继电器初始状态为关，它将被设为高电平，然后 3 秒后再次切换为低电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1947
#: 22249d610d2846579b1326c9a63a9cab
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1951
#: 295ed0283d504a1da68a2a06163e352f
msgid ""
"Set a given :ref:`servo pin <common-servo>` output to a specific PWM value."
msgstr "将指定的 :ref:`舵机引脚 <common-servo>` 输出设置为特定 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2007
#: 8df383a7966440449c7df3c35c2b3ac6
msgid "Mission Planner Settingsfor DO_SET_SERVO command"
msgstr "DO_SET_SERVO 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2009
#: a59a07ccfe074a70b41cfd94ff46e406
msgid ""
"In the example above, the servo attached to output channel 8 would be moved "
"to PWM 1700 (servos generally accept PWM values between 1000 and 2000)."
msgstr "在上述示例中，连接到输出通道 8 的舵机将移动到 PWM 1700（舵机通常接受 1000 到 2000 之间的 PWM 值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2013
#: 0ddde6444ced45849d04527bdf450c35
msgid ""
"as of firmware versions 4.0 and later, this command can be used on any "
"output configured by its ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` command as 0,1, or 51-66  "
"(disabled or RC pass-throughs)"
msgstr ""
"从固件 4.0 版本起，此指令可用于任何通过 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 命令配置为 0、1 或 51-66（禁用或 RC 直通）的输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2018
#: c00eefb5e67344378a22df089f085031
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2022
#: bdd8eef863914765883626769f5a78ba
msgid ""
"Cycle a :ref:`servo <common-servo>` PWM output pin between its mid-position "
"value and a specified PWM value, for a given number of cycles and with a set"
" period."
msgstr ""
"在给定周期和设定次数内，将 :ref:`舵机 <common-servo>` PWM 输出引脚在其中间位置值和指定 PWM 值之间循环切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2026
#: 8c6c93279ae044e1af314f741a08d38d
msgid ""
"The mid-position value is specified in the ``RCn_TRIM`` parameter for the "
"channel (``RC8_TRIM`` in the screenshot below). The default value is 1500.."
msgstr "中间位置值在该通道的 ``RCn_TRIM`` 参数中指定（下方截图中为 ``RC8_TRIM``）。默认值为 1500。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2084
#: 3e5fd14f9fe44b7bb83944e9cc5a12df
msgid "Mission Planner Settingsfor DO_REPEAT_SERVO command"
msgstr "DO_REPEAT_SERVO 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2086
#: 7bcdbc4119374d69bba50d46fc70392b
msgid ""
"In the example above, the servo attached to output channel 8 would be moved "
"to PWM 1700, then after 4 second, back to mid, after another 4 seconds it "
"would be moved to 1700 again, then finally after 4 more seconds it would be "
"moved back to mid."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，连接到输出通道 8 的舵机将移动到 PWM 1700，4 秒后返回中间位置，再过 4 秒后再次移动到 1700，最后再过 4 "
"秒后返回中间位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2096
#: 600ba3371c9448c79fa5ef2802ed4bf4
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_LAND_START"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_LAND_START"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2100
#: a872907797bf487f87f9ca063d665281
msgid "Mission command to prepare for a landing."
msgstr "用于准备降落的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2102
#: f9c800b2808e4a57af740d6b90001df9
msgid ""
"This is used as a marker in a mission to tell the autopilot where a sequence"
" of mission items that represents a landing starts. It may also be sent via "
"a ``COMMAND_LONG`` to trigger a landing, in which case the nearest "
"(geographically) landing sequence in the mission will be used."
msgstr ""
"这用于在任务中标记一系列表示降落开始的任务项。它也可以通过 ``COMMAND_LONG`` "
"发送以触发降落，在这种情况下将使用任务中最近（地理上）的降落序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2107
#: 9e231aad26d3475da803214f68f3322e
msgid ""
"If ``RTL_AUTOLAND`` is set to 2, the plane will jump to the nearest "
"``DO_LAND_START`` in the mission table when RTL is initialized."
msgstr "如果 ``RTL_AUTOLAND`` 设置为 2，当初始化 RTL 时，飞机将跳转到任务表中最近的 ``DO_LAND_START``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2112
#: d1fc6fab48e44809b107d117eca54182
msgid ""
"General information on landing a plane is provided in the topic "
":ref:`Automatic Landing <automatic-landing>`."
msgstr "有关降落飞机的一般信息请参阅 :ref:`自动降落 <automatic-landing>` 主题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2167
#: 6ef732ec383640fb9b41be2868af88ee
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_VTOL_TRANSITION"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_VTOL_TRANSITION"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2169
#: abca1f9f76014feca126525710470286
msgid "Supported by: Plane (not Copter or Rover).Specifically QuadPlanes."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter / Rover）。具体为 QuadPlane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2171
#: 58b2529f2c484d468ac479a4dd3ffcc0
msgid ""
"Mission command to change to/from VTOL and fixed wing mode of flight. The "
"mode is changed based on the first parameter: 3 = change to VTOL flight, 4 ="
" change to fixed wing flight."
msgstr "任务命令，用于切换 VTOL 和固定翼飞行模式。模式根据第一个参数更改：3 = 切换到 VTOL 飞行，4 = 切换到固定翼飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2228
#: 5cad6b37980c4c41a75b0f729e3ab29f
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2235
#: a73b2cf0686c4466890084dd41c3c815
msgid ""
"Points the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` at the \"region"
" of interest\"."
msgstr "将 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` 指向「兴趣区域」（ROI）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2238
#: 3761a3766ab14a50b8c6135edb9f61d2
msgid ""
"After setting the ROI, the camera will continue to follow it until the end "
"of the mission, unless it is changed or cleared by setting another ROI. "
"Clearing the ROI is achieved by setting a later DO_SET_ROI command with all "
"zeros for ``param5``-``param7`` (Lat, Lon and Alt)."
msgstr ""
"设置 ROI 后，相机会一直跟随该 ROI 直到任务结束；除非通过设置新的 ROI 改变或清除。清除 ROI 的方法是发送一条 DO_SET_ROI "
"指令，将 ``param5``-``param7`` （Lat、Lon、Alt）全部置为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2302
#: 6583eb524d9d476c9ab51d0963dfd4ba
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONFIGURE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONFIGURE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2306
#: 97549d0947e64b6aa8cc01cc60cadcb4
msgid "Configure an on-board camera controller system."
msgstr "配置机载相机控制器系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2308
#: 46013cfbd5d9491c95c122d6e0d1f1e6
msgid ""
"The parameters are forwarded to an on-board camera controller system (like "
"the `3DR Camera Control Board <common-camera-control-board>`__), if one is "
"present."
msgstr ""
"参数将被转发到机载相机控制器系统（如 `3DR Camera Control Board <common-camera-control-"
"board>`__）（如果存在）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2378
#: adfd6c3eb6b34f9d9ea9fed8fd7ce986
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2382
#: 60e07eb895c1493b818a8e4b4824009e
msgid ""
"Trigger the :ref:`camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` once. "
"This command takes no additional arguments."
msgstr "触发 :ref:`相机快门 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` 一次。此指令不需要额外参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2386
#: cd83906ab81b4a1a946e1c3dbb2506c4
msgid "In general, if a command field is set to 0 it is ignored."
msgstr "通常，如果指令字段设置为 0，则被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2451
#: fbd86cf5437d446086a4a01566d32bdb
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL command."
msgstr "DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL 指令的 Mission Planner 设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2456
#: 793567e523e34c99b8524a92ca1cf4cc
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2460
#: 875d804873ab40bf8f6d19d4c2388276
msgid "Mission command to control a camera or antenna mount."
msgstr "用于控制相机或天线挂载的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2462
#: 78d5ba81f1904c369a0ee94b0b37188e
msgid ""
"This command allows you to specify a roll, pitch and yaw angle which will be"
" sent to the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. This can be "
"used to point the camera in specific directions at various times in the "
"mission."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许您指定横滚、俯仰和偏航角度，并将其发送至 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`。可用于在任务的不同时刻将相机指向特定方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2521
#: 9560aeade61d4e2bbe40699850ec3917
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_MOUNT_CONTROL command"
msgstr "DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2526
#: d655bb25393e4175bf6a4b6674dc18ab
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2530
#: 928eac47c32e4ce7b356132a9b74ed6c
msgid ""
"Mission command to move the gimbal to the desired pitch and yaw angles (in "
"degrees)."
msgstr "将云台移动到期望俯仰和偏航角度（度）的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2532
#: c7cdb66ff7d64b6ba7f46a96bf99ba33
msgid ""
"This command allows you to specify a pitch and yaw angle which will be sent "
"to the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. This can be used "
"to point the camera in specific directions at various times in the mission. "
"Positive pitch angles are up, Negative are down.  Positive yaw angles are "
"clockwise, negative are counter clockwise."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许您指定俯仰和偏航角度，并将其发送至 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`。可用于在任务的不同时刻将相机指向特定方向。俯仰角正值表示向上，负值表示向下。偏航角正值为顺时针，负值为逆时针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2591
#: ebbe3b72b93141e8b223f788b481f851
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW command"
msgstr "DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2596
#: ee848277ef72429a902c594aa5a61f90
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2600
#: 2ebd42b478ff40a38e5fda86199d28d9
msgid ""
"Trigger the :ref:`camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` at "
"regular distance intervals. This command is useful in :ref:`camera survey "
"missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`. To "
"trigger the camera once, immediately after passing the DO command, set "
"param3 to 1."
msgstr ""
"以固定距离间隔触发 :ref:`相机快门 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>`。此指令在 :ref:`相机航拍任务 "
"<common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>` 中很有用。如需在经过 DO "
"指令后立即触发相机一次，将 param3 设为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2606
#: fcfbbf0fb7e2490e808ddd77db303540
msgid ""
"Providing a distance of zero will stop the camera shutter from being "
"triggered."
msgstr "将距离设为零将停止相机快门的触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2661
#: cd1032186ab443a98a59c99f39009928
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST command"
msgstr "DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2663
#: f47a48fbf6f749a79169cf3ca25d2367
msgid ""
"The above configuration will cause the camera shutter to trigger after every"
" 5m that the vehicle travels."
msgstr "上述配置将使相机快门在飞行器每飞行 5m 后触发一次。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2670
#: 0f089ce6f37f40dfb623ff9b4a016ec0
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2674
#: 7bca8abab9b140cb9cf4155a0d891ec1
msgid ""
"Mission commands to enable the Plane :ref:`GeoFence <geofencing>`, "
"Copter/Rover :ref:`common-ac2_simple_geofence` and/or :ref:`common-"
"polygon_fence`."
msgstr ""
"启用 Plane :ref:`电子围栏 <geofencing>`、Copter/Rover :ref:`common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence` 和/或 :ref:`common-polygon_fence` 的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2729
#: 0502b676d071499aa003ceddc38e38f2
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_AUX_FUNCTION"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_AUX_FUNCTION"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2733
#: 920f13a95f7746388e6fc716083a6f28
msgid ""
"Mission command to control an :ref:`Auxiliary Function<common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` in the same manner as an RC channel switch."
msgstr "以与 RC 通道开关相同方式控制 :ref:`辅助功能<common-auxiliary-functions>` 的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2794
#: 40a8a117bcd84c47b5165f60d09f3294
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_INVERTED_FLIGHT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_INVERTED_FLIGHT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2798
#: e8950819a08e48ae82539a0a05e69e11
msgid "Change between normal and :ref:`inverted flight <inverted-flight>`."
msgstr "在正常飞行和 :ref:`倒飞 <inverted-flight>` 之间切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2864
#: b56b22db898b44fcb6093d49608557bd
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_AUTOTUNE_ENABLE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_AUTOTUNE_ENABLE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2868
#: ee95fce38b8d4d4fa583034c72813d48
