msgstr "启用/禁用 :ref:`AUTOTUNE <autotune-mode>` 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2922
#: 657322c5800545b9ba72f0cdbdcc95ce
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_ENGINE_CONTROL"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_ENGINE_CONTROL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2926
#: 1bece13dc3224eb5b84ea0949c3c7703
msgid "Stop or start the internal combustion engine (ICE)"
msgstr "停止或启动内燃机（ICE）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2928
#: 9d7c7a56bbae447893eea2d07ea7050b
msgid ""
"This command can be used to start or stop the ICE before a NAV_VTOL_LAND or "
"after a NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF command for a QuadPlane to avoid potential prop "
"strikes in the wind. It should be placed before either of those "
"commands.Also can be used to allow a single engine start while disarmed if "
"otherwise prohibited by :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 3 being set,"
msgstr ""
"此命令可用于在 NAV_VTOL_LAND 之前或 NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF 命令之后为四旋翼飞机启动或停止 "
"ICE，以避免在风中潜在的螺旋桨碰撞。应将其放置在这些命令之前。也可用于在否则被 :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 3"
" 位禁止时允许在解锁状态下单次启动发动机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2981
#: 01dd35b083154543ab8a750eb839e88d
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2985
#: 44ef55a21d354e34987eba0fc7f44575
msgid ""
"Set the distance that the mission will be rewound when resuming after an "
"interrupt (switching modes).  A full explanation of this feature can be "
"found on the :ref:`Mission Rewind on Resume Page <common-mission-rewind>`.  "
"After setting a rewind distance in a mission, setting the distance to zero "
"will switch off the rewind feature from that point on the mission."
msgstr ""
"设置中断（切换模式）后恢复任务时任务将回退的距离。此功能的完整说明请参阅 :ref:`任务恢复回退页面 <common-mission-"
"rewind>`。在任务中设置回退距离后，将距离设为零将从该点起关闭回退功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:3039
#: 1d3fc84997c14af9bc576127c57fb4dc
msgid "MAV_CMD_STORAGE_FORMAT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_STORAGE_FORMAT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:3043
#: c3063ede93bc47cd94c55a5cb15bf436
