"Format SD Card. Useful for vehicles where SD card is inaccessible. Param1 "
"and Param2 must be set to 1."
msgstr "格式化 SD 卡。适用于 SD 卡无法访问的飞行器。Param1 和 Param2 必须设为 1。"

